cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Field Shuffle in a project that generates a research output,
  please cite this software in addition to citing REDCap.

type: software

title: "Field Shuffle (REDCap External Module)"

abstract: >-
  Field Shuffle is a REDCap External Module for randomizing the display order
  of fields on REDCap survey pages and data entry forms. It stores the
  displayed order in a designated text field, can replay an already stored
  order, and supports shuffling individual fields or grouped blocks of fields
  through the @SHUFFLE-FIELDS-SURVEY and @SHUFFLE-FIELDS-DATAENTRY action tags.

